{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y90nupkv","slideIndex":0,"text":"Kettoo is a native Android app, browser console and organisation-hosted backend for event communication and coordination. The implementation includes live push-to-talk, messages, venue check-ins and issue workflows. Source: PROJECT_SUMMARY.md and README.md in the Kettoo project, reviewed 10 October 2026. Team name: Codio, as supplied by the presenter. Team number omitted at the presenter's request."}
